<title>USA: McDonald sets 2-for-1 stock split, ups div.</title>
<headline>McDonald sets 2-for-1 stock split, ups div.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>McDonald &amp; Investments Inc said Wednesday its board approved a two-for-one stock split, which will be distributed on September 15 to shareholders of record on August 25.</p>
<p>McDonald said it raised its quarterly dividend to $0.125 per share from $0.09375 per share and is payable August 22 to shareholders of record as of August 13.</p>
<p>After the record date, the post-split cash dividend will be $0.625 per share, the company said.</p>
</text>
